# Partner collection: Zenbivy sleep gear. Regenerated on every build.
zenbivy_body="<section class=\"hero\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">CAMPING SLEEP GEAR • AFFILIATE PICKS</p><h1>Zenbivy sleeping gear: six options to compare.</h1><p class=\"lede\">Choose a sleep system around the temperature, campsite, weight and budget of the trip—not the most expensive kit.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"#products\">Compare the six picks ↓</a></div></section><section><p class=\"fine\"><strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> Links below are paid affiliate links. Trailwise Gear may earn a commission on qualifying purchases at no additional cost to you. This is a research-based product roundup, not a hands-on review; we have not personally tested these six items. Product prices, availability, fit and specifications may change.</p><h2>How to choose</h2><p>Start with an appropriately rated quilt or sleep system and a suitable insulated pad. Check manufacturer temperature guidance, mattress R-value, size, packed weight, return policy and current price. For car camping, weight may matter less than comfort; for backpacking, carry weight and volume matter more.</p></section><section id=\"products\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">ZENBIVY COLLECTION</p><h2>Six products to explore</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Zenbivy • Camping sleep gear</p><h3>Core Quilt</h3><p>An entry-level quilt option to compare for your planned overnight temperatures.</p><a href=\"https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=pl&amp;ti=9845&amp;pw=448969&amp;mi=23465&amp;pt=3&amp;pri=411\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\">View Core Quilt at Zenbivy →</a></article><article class=\"card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Zenbivy • Camping sleep gear</p><h3>Light Quilt</h3><p>A lighter quilt option for campers who care about pack weight.</p><a href=\"https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=pl&amp;ti=9845&amp;pw=448969&amp;mi=23465&amp;pt=3&amp;pri=402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\">View Light Quilt at Zenbivy →</a></article><article class=\"card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Zenbivy • Camping sleep gear</p><h3>Flex Air Mattress</h3><p>An inflatable sleeping pad to compare for comfort, dimensions and packed size.</p><a href=\"https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=pl&amp;ti=9845&amp;pw=448969&amp;mi=23465&amp;pt=3&amp;pri=403\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\">View Flex Air Mattress at Zenbivy →</a></article><article class=\"card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Zenbivy • Camping sleep gear</p><h3>Core ZipBed</h3><p>An integrated sleep-system option; compare total cost against buying components separately.</p><a href=\"https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=pl&amp;ti=9845&amp;pw=448969&amp;mi=23465&amp;pt=3&amp;pri=697\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\">View Core ZipBed at Zenbivy →</a></article><article class=\"card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Zenbivy • Camping sleep gear</p><h3>Dry Sack</h3><p>A simple storage accessory; check its waterproofing claims and intended use before relying on it.</p><a href=\"https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=pl&amp;ti=9845&amp;pw=448969&amp;mi=23465&amp;pt=3&amp;pri=431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\">View Dry Sack at Zenbivy →</a></article><article class=\"card\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Zenbivy • Camping sleep gear</p><h3>Overland ZipBed</h3><p>A vehicle-camping sleep-system option to compare for drive-up adventures.</p><a href=\"https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=pl&amp;ti=9845&amp;pw=448969&amp;mi=23465&amp;pt=3&amp;pri=692\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\">View Overland ZipBed at Zenbivy →</a></article></div></section><section><h2>Don't overspend on the first trip</h2><p>Before buying, compare the full sleep setup—not just a quilt or mattress by itself. If you already own suitable gear, try it on a short, manageable trip first. Check nighttime forecasts and leave a margin for colder-than-expected conditions.</p><p><a href=\"/guides/foam-vs-inflatable-sleeping-pad/\">Read: foam vs. inflatable sleeping pads →</a></p><p><a href=\"/guides/budget-camping-gear-buying-order/\">Read: a budget camping gear buying order →</a></p></section>"
page('zenbivy-sleep-gear/index.html', 'Zenbivy camping sleep gear: six products to compare', 'Research-based Zenbivy quilt, mattress and sleep-system options with disclosed affiliate links.', zenbivy_body)
zenbivy_feature='<section id="zenbivy-sleep-gear"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">CAMPING SLEEP SYSTEMS</p><h2>Explore Zenbivy sleep gear.</h2></div></div><p>Compare six quilts, mattresses, accessories and vehicle-camping sleep systems. Research-based selections, not hands-on testing.</p><p class="fine"><strong>Affiliate disclosure:</strong> Product links on the collection page are affiliate links; Trailwise Gear may earn a commission.</p><a class="button" href="/zenbivy-sleep-gear/">Explore Zenbivy picks →</a></section>'
